§§ `The qualifying age (section 1(6)) and pensionable age before 6 April 2016 (section 3(1)(a))`

-- K1: a MAN, M1, on 1 January 2012. His qualifying age was attained on 10 May 2010 (the day a woman born on his birthday reached pensionable age), so he has attained it, though his own pensionable age day is 10 May 2015. Income 100: GC = 100. Savings credit: his own pensionable age (10 May 2015) is before 6 April 2016, but he is not yet 65 (65th birthday 10 May 2015), so 3(1)(a) fails.
