-- W5: born 1 January 1938, so 75 on 1 January 2013 (before the 2015 decisions below).
GIVETH A Person
`woman W5` MEANS
    Person WITH
        sex IS Woman
        `date of birth` IS YearMonthDay 1938 1 1
        `day pensionable age is attained` IS YearMonthDay 1998 1 1
        `day a woman born on the same day attains pensionable age` IS YearMonthDay 1998 1 1

